    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a nimble cat leaping through adorable color-themed levels.\u00a0</strong>This is a game about jumping, climbing, and discovering \u2014 all from the paws of a small, agile cat. With tight controls, handcrafted levels, and an honest love for platformers, this game keeps things simple at heart while letting the world grow around you as it\u00a0challenges your reflexes and curiosity as you traverse over 60 levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Straightforward Platformer at Its Core</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of classic platformers \u2014 responsive controls, thoughtful level layouts, and no fluff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >less dialogue, no cutscenes \u2014 just gameplay, discovery, and flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level teaches through play. You learn by doing, failing, and trying again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Pixel-Artsy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals stay humble \u2014 clean pixel art with a soft touch. Every block is placed with care, keeping things clear without overcomplicating the screen.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds use gentle parallax and color to give depth without distraction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realms are themed but not flashy: sky steel, glowing libraries, earthy caves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s cozy, readable, and easy on the eyes \u2014 like the platformers you grew up with, but touched by something slightly dreamlike.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Mechanics, Precise Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by the soft visuals or chill vibe \u2014 this game gets tough.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight jumps</strong>, <strong>tricky timing</strong>, and machanic-based puzzles<strong>\u00a0</strong>will push your reflexes and your patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes are frequent, but restarts are instant. It\u2019s all about repetition and improvement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a nimble cat leaping through adorable color-themed levels.\u00a0</strong>This is a game about jumping, climbing, and discovering \u2014 all from the paws of a small, agile cat. With tight controls, handcrafted levels, and an honest love for platformers, this game keeps things simple at heart while letting the world grow around you as it\u00a0challenges your reflexes and curiosity as you traverse over 60 levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Straightforward Platformer at Its Core</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for fans of classic platformers \u2014 responsive controls, thoughtful level layouts, and no fluff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >less dialogue, no cutscenes \u2014 just gameplay, discovery, and flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level teaches through play. You learn by doing, failing, and trying again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Pixel-Artsy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The visuals stay humble \u2014 clean pixel art with a soft touch. Every block is placed with care, keeping things clear without overcomplicating the screen.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backgrounds use gentle parallax and color to give depth without distraction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realms are themed but not flashy: sky steel, glowing libraries, earthy caves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s cozy, readable, and easy on the eyes \u2014 like the platformers you grew up with, but touched by something slightly dreamlike.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple Mechanics, Precise Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t be fooled by the soft visuals or chill vibe \u2014 this game gets tough.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight jumps</strong>, <strong>tricky timing</strong>, and machanic-based puzzles<strong>\u00a0</strong>will push your reflexes and your patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mistakes are frequent, but restarts are instant. It\u2019s all about repetition and improvement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
